cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Jezero Rover Agent
abstract: >-
  An autonomous rover agent simulation on real Jezero Crater terrain (a 2 km window of the 1 m HiRISE DTM and 25 cm
  orthoimage, with the Stack et al. 2020 geologic map). The agent perceives through a simulated mast camera, plans
  slope-aware drives under an energy budget, assesses evidence consistent with past habitable conditions, and
  downlinks prioritised findings to Earth over a delayed, bandwidth-limited link.
type: software
